# Koleksi permintaan uji /profiles dan endpoint laporan (REST Client VS Code / IntelliJ HTTP Client)
# Penulis: Chandra TW
# Isi token ayah dan anak dari Supabase Auth sebelum dipakai.
@base = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@rt = <household_id>
@tokenAyah = <access_token_ayah>
@tokenAnak = <access_token_anak>

### 401 tanpa token
GET {{base}}/profiles/me

### Profil sendiri
GET {{base}}/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAyah}}

### Ubah nama tampilan sendiri (200)
PATCH {{base}}/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAyah}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "full_name": "Budi Santoso" }

### Ubah dengan badan kosong (400)
PATCH {{base}}/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAyah}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Ringkasan dashboard bulan berjalan (semua peran)
GET {{base}}/dashboard/summary?household_id={{rt}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAyah}}

### Ringkasan dashboard oleh anak (tetap 200)
GET {{base}}/dashboard/summary?household_id={{rt}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAnak}}

### Arus kas (ayah dan ibu)
GET {{base}}/reports/cashflow?household_id={{rt}}&from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAyah}}

### Arus kas oleh anak (403)
GET {{base}}/reports/cashflow?household_id={{rt}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAnak}}

### Laporan rumah tangga lain (403)
GET {{base}}/reports/cashflow?household_id=<household_id_rumah_tangga_lain>
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAyah}}

### Rekap kategori
GET {{base}}/reports/categories?household_id={{rt}}&from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAyah}}

### Rekap anggota
GET {{base}}/reports/members?household_id={{rt}}&from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAyah}}

### Ekspor CSV
GET {{base}}/reports/export.csv?household_id={{rt}}&from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAyah}}
